{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39688","headline":"喜侯舍人蜀中新命三首 一 · 黄滔","name":"喜侯舍人蜀中新命三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八都词客漫喧然，谁解飞扬诰誓间。\n五色彩毫裁凤诏，九重天子豁龙颜。\n巴山月在趋朝去，锦水烟生入合还。\n谋及中兴多少事，莫愁明月不收关。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39688.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39688","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}